# 入れ子の agent で実行したツールと経過時間も外側に数え、内側の上限が大きくても外側の残りを超えない（AI-006、ADR-0023 論点 9・13・14）
# expect-stdout: inner budget: max_tool_calls exceeded
# expect-stdout: outer ok done
# expect-stdout: inner timeout: timeout_ms exceeded
# expect-stdout: outer timeout: timeout_ms exceeded
@tool(description="Tick.")
def tick() -> None uses pure:
    pass

@tool(description="Waits.")
async def wait() -> None uses pure:
    await sleep_ms(100)

@agent(tools=[tick, wait], capabilities=["llm"], max_tool_calls=10, timeout_ms=1000)
async def inner() -> Result[str, LlmError] uses llm:
    req = LlmRequest(model="", system="", messages=[Message(role="user", content="go")], max_tokens=0)
    return await llm_generate[str](req)

@tool(description="Delegate.")
async def delegate() -> str uses io, llm:
    match await inner():
        case Ok(t):
            print("inner ok " + t)
        case Err(e):
            print("inner " + e.kind + ": " + e.message)
    return ""

@agent(tools=[delegate], capabilities=["io", "llm"], max_tool_calls=2)
async def tools() -> Result[str, LlmError] uses io, llm:
    req = LlmRequest(model="", system="", messages=[Message(role="user", content="go")], max_tokens=0)
    return await llm_generate[str](req)

@agent(tools=[delegate], capabilities=["io", "llm"], timeout_ms=50)
async def time() -> Result[str, LlmError] uses io, llm:
    req = LlmRequest(model="", system="", messages=[Message(role="user", content="go")], max_tokens=0)
    return await llm_generate[str](req)

def report(r: Result[str, LlmError]) -> None uses io:
    match r:
        case Ok(t):
            print("outer ok " + t)
        case Err(e):
            print("outer " + e.kind + ": " + e.message)

async def main() -> None uses io, llm:
    delegate_call = MockToolCall(name="delegate", args_json="{}")
    tick_call = MockToolCall(name="tick", args_json="{}")
    wait_call = MockToolCall(name="wait", args_json="{}")
    llm_mock_push(MockResponse(text="", tool_calls=[delegate_call], input_tokens=1, output_tokens=1, latency_ms=0))
    llm_mock_push(MockResponse(text="", tool_calls=[tick_call], input_tokens=1, output_tokens=1, latency_ms=0))
    llm_mock_push(MockResponse(text="", tool_calls=[tick_call], input_tokens=1, output_tokens=1, latency_ms=0))
    llm_mock_push(MockResponse(text="done", tool_calls=[], input_tokens=1, output_tokens=1, latency_ms=0))
    report(await tools())
    llm_mock_push(MockResponse(text="", tool_calls=[delegate_call], input_tokens=1, output_tokens=1, latency_ms=0))
    llm_mock_push(MockResponse(text="", tool_calls=[wait_call], input_tokens=1, output_tokens=1, latency_ms=0))
    report(await time())
